<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $1 million European Community tennis championship on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>6-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-3 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat 7-Michael Stich 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Christophe Van Garsse (Belgium) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-0 6-2  </p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
